{
  "_comment": "Grafana-managed rules (POST /api/v1/provisioning/alert-rules, X-Disable-Provenance), same shape as cognee-setup grafana/alerts/cognee-health.json. Source series: postgres_exporter v0.17.1 of the pg-shared job (KSonny4/nomad-postgresql#1) scraped as job=\"pg-shared\" and Nomad host telemetry, both remote-written by jobs/nomad-metrics-alloy.nomad.hcl. Receiver keeper-telegram, folder MAIN, datasource grafanacloud-prom (confirm all three exist in the stack at import). Import-ready only: not live until imported, bound and a test page arrives. No secrets.",
  "rules": [
    {
      "uid": "pg-shared-down",
      "orgID": 1,
      "folderUID": "ffz5bcn0ps4qob",
      "ruleGroup": "pg-shared",
      "title": "pg-shared down (pg_up==0 or no scrape for 5m)",
      "condition": "C",
      "data": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 600,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "grafanacloud-prom",
          "model": {
            "expr": "min(pg_up{job=\"pg-shared\"}) or on() vector(0)",
            "intervalMs": 60000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200,
            "refId": "A"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "queryType": "",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 0,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "datasource": {
              "type": "__expr__",
              "uid": "__expr__"
            },
            "expression": "A",
            "reducer": "last",
            "refId": "B",
            "type": "reduce",
            "intervalMs": 1000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "queryType": "",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 0,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "datasource": {
              "type": "__expr__",
              "uid": "__expr__"
            },
            "expression": "$B < 1",
            "refId": "C",
            "type": "math",
            "intervalMs": 1000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200
          }
        }
      ],
      "noDataState": "Alerting",
      "execErrState": "Error",
      "for": "5m",
      "annotations": {
        "summary": "pg-shared PostgreSQL is unreachable: postgres_exporter reports pg_up==0, or the exporter at 127.0.0.1:9187 has not been scraped (series absent) for 5 minutes. Every tenant database is down.",
        "runbook": "KSonny4/nomad-postgresql docs/runbooks/ (pg-shared); alerts listed in docs/cd-exception.md"
      },
      "labels": {
        "service": "pg-shared",
        "severity": "critical"
      },
      "isPaused": false,
      "notification_settings": {
        "receiver": "keeper-telegram"
      }
    },
    {
      "uid": "pg-shared-wal-archive-stale",
      "orgID": 1,
      "folderUID": "ffz5bcn0ps4qob",
      "ruleGroup": "pg-shared",
      "title": "pg-shared WAL archive stale (>15m)",
      "condition": "C",
      "data": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 600,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "grafanacloud-prom",
          "model": {
            "expr": "(time() - max(pg_shared_archiver_last_archived_timestamp_seconds{job=\"pg-shared\"})) and on() (max(pg_up{job=\"pg-shared\"}) == 1)",
            "intervalMs": 60000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200,
            "refId": "A"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "queryType": "",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 0,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "datasource": {
              "type": "__expr__",
              "uid": "__expr__"
            },
            "expression": "A",
            "reducer": "last",
            "refId": "B",
            "type": "reduce",
            "intervalMs": 1000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "queryType": "",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 0,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "datasource": {
              "type": "__expr__",
              "uid": "__expr__"
            },
            "expression": "$B > 900",
            "refId": "C",
            "type": "math",
            "intervalMs": 1000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200
          }
        }
      ],
      "noDataState": "OK",
      "execErrState": "Error",
      "for": "0s",
      "annotations": {
        "summary": "No WAL segment has been archived by pgBackRest for more than 15 minutes (archive_timeout=300 plus the 5-minute sidecar heartbeat guarantee a switch at least every 5 minutes). Point-in-time recovery is falling behind. A value near now() means the last archive time is 0, i.e. nothing was ever archived.",
        "runbook": "KSonny4/nomad-postgresql docs/runbooks/ (pg-shared); alerts listed in docs/cd-exception.md"
      },
      "labels": {
        "service": "pg-shared",
        "severity": "critical"
      },
      "isPaused": false,
      "notification_settings": {
        "receiver": "keeper-telegram"
      }
    },
    {
      "uid": "pg-shared-wal-archive-failing",
      "orgID": 1,
      "folderUID": "ffz5bcn0ps4qob",
      "ruleGroup": "pg-shared",
      "title": "pg-shared WAL archive failures",
      "condition": "C",
      "data": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 1800,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "grafanacloud-prom",
          "model": {
            "expr": "increase(pg_shared_archiver_failed_count{job=\"pg-shared\"}[15m]) and on() (max(pg_up{job=\"pg-shared\"}) == 1)",
            "intervalMs": 60000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200,
            "refId": "A"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "queryType": "",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 0,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "datasource": {
              "type": "__expr__",
              "uid": "__expr__"
            },
            "expression": "A",
            "reducer": "last",
            "refId": "B",
            "type": "reduce",
            "intervalMs": 1000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "queryType": "",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 0,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "datasource": {
              "type": "__expr__",
              "uid": "__expr__"
            },
            "expression": "$B > 0",
            "refId": "C",
            "type": "math",
            "intervalMs": 1000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200
          }
        }
      ],
      "noDataState": "OK",
      "execErrState": "Error",
      "for": "0s",
      "annotations": {
        "summary": "pg_stat_archiver.failed_count increased in the last 15 minutes: archive_command (pgbackrest archive-push to R2) is failing. WAL piles up in pg_wal until it recovers.",
        "runbook": "KSonny4/nomad-postgresql docs/runbooks/ (pg-shared); alerts listed in docs/cd-exception.md"
      },
      "labels": {
        "service": "pg-shared",
        "severity": "warning"
      },
      "isPaused": false,
      "notification_settings": {
        "receiver": "keeper-telegram"
      }
    },
    {
